  questionText: Mayor Bunyon has admitted to cheating on you.
  largeQuestionBox: 0
  conversation:
  - '!..'
  - ...
  - I...
  - ...
  - <i>He did it.</i>
  - "There\u2019s no use pretending anymore. He did it. We all know, don\u2019t we?
    <i>You</i> certainly know!"
  - "Why are we all pretending that this entire thing isn\u2019t as obvious as it
    looks!? I know you have to do it by the book, but\u2014 but <i>come on now</i>!"
  - "It\u2019s open and closed! That\u2013 that <i>fucker</i> threw some poor soul
    onto the lines, they were fried to a <i>crisp</i>, and it put the power out.
    1-<b></b>2-<b></b>3!<b></b> What are you still missing!?"
  - "Wh\u2013 <i>what?</i> What does that prove? I\u2019m sorry but if this sort
    of\u2013 of pedantic <i>nonsense</i> is the reason my husband is still walking
    free, then I\u2019m not impressed!"
  - "I mean if that\u2019s true, then it only means that they were dropped onto the
    lines <i>before</i> the outage!"
  - What? He... but... but <i>that</i>...
  - "Look! Clearly someone\u2019s gotten their times mixed up, or... or there\u2019s
    something you\u2019ve overlooked! Because, I mean, have you not <i>seen</i> the
    body?"
  - "There\u2019s nothing else that could have done... <i>that</i> to someone, so
    clearly you\u2019ve gotten something wrong!"
  - "WHAT! <i>WHAT!?</i> You\u2019re accusing <i>me</i> now!?"
  - "Did he\u2013 he <i>paid</i> you! No\u2014 no I bet he <i>fucked you too!</i>"
  - "Have\u2013 have you thought this through at <i>all</i>. <i>Really</i>. Look
    at me!"
  - "How could I have possibly even gotten a body over there?! It wouldn\u2019t be
    possible! What is <i>wrong</i> with you!?"
  - '[MASK SHATTERS]'
  - I...<i>no!</i>
  - Just because I... just because...
  - ...
  - ...
  - I found it there.
  - I... I found <i>them</i> in the kiln.
  - After the power went out, I went to check on the sculpture, and... <i><i><i>God</i>.
  - "<i>The smell</i>. I didn\u2019t even want to open the door. I thought an animal
    must\u2019ve wondered in..."
  - But when I realised what it was, I realised what was happening. Someone was trying
    to frame me!
  - Even if I tried to hide the body, people would put 2-and-2 together and realise
    my kiln had to have been involved.
  - So I thought if... if <i>someone</i> had to be framed...
  - "God I\u2019m glad I wasn\u2019t just paranoid."
  - "Isn\u2019t that crazy? \u2018God, I\u2019m glad my husband ended up being a
    cheating bastard after all. Now I don\u2019t have to feel bad for framing him
    for murder.\u2019"
  - Jesus...
  - "<color=notiCol>So I\u2014 I <i>dumped</i> the body onto the trolley\u2013 the
    um, the trolley I use to get my pots and sculptures around town, and I took it
    into his office, up the elevator... and...</color>"
  - "God I\u2019m so sorry! I\u2019ve caused you so much trouble, but I was\u2013
    I was <i>terrified</i>! You have to believe me when I say I didn\u2019t put the
    body in the kiln in the first place! I swear!"
  - "Someone broke in or... or <i>I don\u2019t know</i>..."
  - Please just find whoever did this.
  - And... <i>thanks</i> for telling me about Bunyon.
